adAt":"2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"1129529","title":"The Next Passage (Alternamorphs, #2)","author":"K.A. Applegate","url":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/8985575730?utm_medium=api&utm_source=rss","coverUrl":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/books/1375604644l/1129529._SX98_.jpg","rating":2,"readAt":"2026-09-30T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"42397849","title":"Burnout: The Secret to Unlocking the Stress Cycle","author":"Emily Nagoski","url":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/8930830253?utm_medium=api&utm_source=rss","coverUrl":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/books/1551216612l/42397849._SX98_.jpg","rating":2,"readAt":"2026-09-30T00:00:00.000Z"}]},"mastodonPosts":[{"id":"117508230481757985","url":"https://mastodonapp.uk/@katerberg/117508230481757985","createdAt":"2026-10-26T16:48:22.029Z","contentWarning":"","content":"<p>Spending an extra 20 seconds and going smaller on the initial mixing pour made it way cleaner to have time for the actual <a href=\"https://mastodonapp.uk/tags/LatteArt\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">#<span>LatteArt</span></a> today.</p>","media":[{"id":"117508229154147234","type":"image","url":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/508/229/154/147/234/original/56beb3698b66429a.webp","previewUrl":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/508/229/154/147/234/small/56beb3698b66429a.webp","description":"latte art of a semi-heart in a not neutral mug"}]},{"id":"117507895267702425","url":"https://mastodonapp.uk/@katerberg/117507895267702425","createdAt":"2026-10-26T15:23:07.071Z","contentWarning":"","content":"<p>Signed up with my son for his first 5K (on Thanksgiving). Should be fun to see if he feels that all the early morning training was worth it when we’re out there for real!</p><p><a href=\"https://mastodonapp.uk/tags/running\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">#<span>running</span></a> <a href=\"https://mastodonapp.uk/tags/parenting\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">#<span>parenting</span></a></p>","media":[]},{"id":"117503744178368007","url":"https://mastodonapp.uk/@katerberg/117503744178368007","createdAt":"2026-10-25T21:47:26.497Z","contentWarning":"","content":"<p>Watched The Awful Truth. RomCom has a pretty pre-code feel despite technically not violating the Hayes Code. Cary Grant is fantastic, and Dunne feels like a Hepburn clone in parts, but probably they’re all just in the same soup. Lots of small moments that show why they’re both stars.</p><p><a href=\"https://mastodonapp.uk/tags/MovieReview\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">#<span>MovieReview</span></a></p>","media":[{"id":"117503744081316344","type":"image","url":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/503/744/081/316/344/original/30f62a73ddc75481.jpg","previewUrl":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/503/744/081/316/344/small/30f62a73ddc75481.jpg","description":"Grant and Dunne with some Cowboy"}]},{"id":"117503457723663229","url":"https://mastodonapp.uk/@katerberg/117503457723663229","createdAt":"2026-10-25T20:34:35.524Z","contentWarning":"","content":"<p>I had a fun time animating a Grave Lily decaying for a Dot-Man power-up! Not the most complex art or animation, but it is a nice little touch for the game feel.</p><p><a href=\"https://mastodonapp.uk/tags/pixelArt\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">#<span>pixelArt</span></a></p>","media":[{"id":"117503456911874405","type":"gifv","url":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/503/456/911/874/405/original/6e0fcb026856b827.mp4","previewUrl":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/503/456/911/874/405/small/6e0fcb026856b827.png","description":"Grave lily decaying"}]},{"id":"117487707747133379","url":"https://mastodonapp.uk/@katerberg/117487707747133379","createdAt":"2026-10-23T01:49:09.951Z","contentWarning":"","content":"<p>Watched The Amazing Adventure. Cary Grant was fantastic despite being in a fairly predictable plot. Sadly the cut that survived the war was about 20 minutes shorter than the original and it showed in parts. Fun as a time capsule of the Great Depression!</p><p><a href=\"https://mastodonapp.uk/tags/MovieReview\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">#<span>MovieReview</span></a></p>","media":[{"id":"117487707636466351","type":"image","url":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/487/707/636/466/351/original/bb58891d0d298046.jpg","previewUrl":"https://files.mastodonapp.uk/media_attachments/files/117/487/707/636/466/351/small/bb58891d0d298046.jpg","description":"Cary Grant looking pretty"}]}]},"__N_SSG":true}